{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Amano": 13,
    "Andou": 13,
    "Player": 23,
    "Ryuuji": 16,
    "Sango": 63
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2201501",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150801": {
            "id": "220150801",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Now, you look kinda interested in the detective agency.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150803",
              "220150808"
            ]
          },
          "220150803": {
            "id": "220150803",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "You want to be a detective? It's a tough job. Don't let fiction fool you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150804"
            ]
          },
          "220150804": {
            "id": "220150804",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "There are no thrilling chases or life and death decisions during cases.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150805"
            ]
          },
          "220150805": {
            "id": "220150805",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Real detective work is more along the lines of files that fill an entire room, muddy mountain roads, and suspects who leave nary a trace...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150806"
            ]
          },
          "220150806": {
            "id": "220150806",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Maybe it's hard to understand from me just describing it... I happen to have a small case open. Why don't you get some personal experience in?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150815"
            ]
          },
          "220150815": {
            "id": "220150815",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "My assistant, Ryuuji, went out to collect clues a little while ago and still hasn't returned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150816"
            ]
          },
          "220150816": {
            "id": "220150816",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "He should have collected enough clues by now, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150817"
            ]
          },
          "220150817": {
            "id": "220150817",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Could you go get Ryuuji for me?"
          },
          "220150808": {
            "id": "220150808",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That's right. Detectives are professional problem solvers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150809"
            ]
          },
          "220150809": {
            "id": "220150809",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Thrilling chases and life and death decisions are just for the novels.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150810"
            ]
          },
          "220150810": {
            "id": "220150810",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Real detective work is more along the lines of files that fill an entire room, muddy mountain roads, and suspects who leave nary a trace...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150811"
            ]
          },
          "220150811": {
            "id": "220150811",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But the novels do get one thing right: detectives always have a variety of assistants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150812"
            ]
          },
          "220150812": {
            "id": "220150812",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So you also have assistants, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150813"
            ]
          },
          "220150813": {
            "id": "220150813",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Of course. Mine is busy outside, as a matter of fact. So now... I'm in need of another one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150814"
            ]
          },
          "220150814": {
            "id": "220150814",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Would you be willing to help me?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201502",
      "subQuestName": "Meet up with Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201503",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Treasure Hoarders",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150301": {
            "id": "220150301",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Miss Sango, is this true?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150302"
            ]
          },
          "220150302": {
            "id": "220150302",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Are the serial burglaries in the city really the work of Treasure Hoarders?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150303"
            ]
          },
          "220150303": {
            "id": "220150303",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That's for certain. I've just shown you the evidence, I'm sure that with your professional instincts, you should have already figured that out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150304"
            ]
          },
          "220150304": {
            "id": "220150304",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "The Treasure Hoarders... how dare they! They have no regard for us at all, do they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150305"
            ]
          },
          "220150305": {
            "id": "220150305",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Amano! Let's go back and report this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150306"
            ]
          },
          "220150306": {
            "id": "220150306",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "We must step up our patrols. We can't give these jerks a single opening.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150307"
            ]
          },
          "220150307": {
            "id": "220150307",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Miss Sango, may we borrow the evidence? We need it to convince the higher-ups to take action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150308"
            ]
          },
          "220150308": {
            "id": "220150308",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "No problem, go ahead. It's not within our agency's ability to handle the Treasure Hoarders. We'll have to rely on the police for that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150309"
            ]
          },
          "220150309": {
            "id": "220150309",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Please rest assured! We shan't let any of the Treasure Hoarders off!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150310"
            ]
          },
          "220150310": {
            "id": "220150310",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Thank you. Now... everything should be ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150312",
              "220150314"
            ]
          },
          "220150312": {
            "id": "220150312",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Yes. The two Doushin from the police station are important \"assistants\" in closing this case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150316"
            ]
          },
          "220150316": {
            "id": "220150316",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After the two Doushin step up their patrols, the Treasure Hoarders in town will be on high alert.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150317"
            ]
          },
          "220150317": {
            "id": "220150317",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ryuuji, you fought with the Treasure Hoarders at the place I asked you to go to, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150318"
            ]
          },
          "220150318": {
            "id": "220150318",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Yes. Traveler and I fought them off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150319"
            ]
          },
          "220150319": {
            "id": "220150319",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Hmm... that's good. You've probably made quite a splash.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150320"
            ]
          },
          "220150320": {
            "id": "220150320",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "All we have to do now is wait for our opportunity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150321"
            ]
          },
          "220150321": {
            "id": "220150321",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Thank you for your help, Traveler. Here's your remuneration.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150322"
            ]
          },
          "220150322": {
            "id": "220150322",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm not sure I've done anything to help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150323"
            ]
          },
          "220150323": {
            "id": "220150323",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Don't say that. You attracted Andou's attention by being an outlander, and got him and Amano to chase you and rendezvous with Ryuuji...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150324"
            ]
          },
          "220150324": {
            "id": "220150324",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Now they've seen the threat of the Treasure Hoarders with their own eyes, which will cause them to step up patrols in the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150325"
            ]
          },
          "220150325": {
            "id": "220150325",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That was all something only you could have done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150326"
            ]
          },
          "220150326": {
            "id": "220150326",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After all, it was more effective to let the Doushin witness the Treasure Hoarders themselves than for me to just tell them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150327"
            ]
          },
          "220150327": {
            "id": "220150327",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Anyway, take these. Who knows? Maybe I'll need your help again some time."
          },
          "220150314": {
            "id": "220150314",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I am a detective, so I plan on solving the case, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150315"
            ]
          },
          "220150315": {
            "id": "220150315",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The two Doushin from the police station are important \"assistants\" in closing that case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201504",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150205"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150205": {
            "id": "220150205",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Ah. You're the assistant Sango was talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150206"
            ]
          },
          "220150206": {
            "id": "220150206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You were expecting me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150207"
            ]
          },
          "220150207": {
            "id": "220150207",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Well... not really. It's just Sango said that someone was coming to help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150208"
            ]
          },
          "220150208": {
            "id": "220150208",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Hey, what are you guys doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150209"
            ]
          },
          "220150209": {
            "id": "220150209",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Are those Treasure Hoarders? Why are they so close to the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150210"
            ]
          },
          "220150210": {
            "id": "220150210",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Ryuuji, why are you here? And this suspicious outlander...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150212",
              "220150214"
            ]
          },
          "220150212": {
            "id": "220150212",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Yeah, I mean, you're the only outlander here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150215"
            ]
          },
          "220150215": {
            "id": "220150215",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Alright, let's not be overly sensitive. Ryuuji, what brings you here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150216"
            ]
          },
          "220150216": {
            "id": "220150216",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I was following a suspicious person here according to Sango's instructions, but then I bumped into some Treasure Hoarders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150217"
            ]
          },
          "220150217": {
            "id": "220150217",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "The Traveler is an assistant invited by Sango. We just drove the Treasure Hoarders off together.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150218"
            ]
          },
          "220150218": {
            "id": "220150218",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "I see... But why would there be Treasure Hoarders nearby?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150219"
            ]
          },
          "220150219": {
            "id": "220150219",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Ryuuji, you just mentioned you were following some suspicious people... Hey! Did you follow the Treasure Hoarders from inside the city?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150220"
            ]
          },
          "220150220": {
            "id": "220150220",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I think so. Sango's been dealing with a serial theft case. I've been searching the city based on her hunch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150221"
            ]
          },
          "220150221": {
            "id": "220150221",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Shortly after, I spotted a suspicious man near Hanamizaka. He left in a panic after I just asked a couple of questions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150222"
            ]
          },
          "220150222": {
            "id": "220150222",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I followed him out of town, and you all know what happened after that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150223"
            ]
          },
          "220150223": {
            "id": "220150223",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Hmm... Ryuuji, how are you suddenly so good at talking? You weren't much of a talker before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150224"
            ]
          },
          "220150224": {
            "id": "220150224",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Working with Sango makes you a good speaker, I see, eh?"
          },
          "220150214": {
            "id": "220150214",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Sango's assistant? Now that sounds even more suspicious..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201505",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201501",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150101": {
            "id": "220150101",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "It's about time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150102"
            ]
          },
          "220150102": {
            "id": "220150102",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Oh-ho, welcome. Are you having a problem?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150103"
            ]
          },
          "220150103": {
            "id": "220150103",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Hm, I see. You don't have any problems... you just want to wander around...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150104"
            ]
          },
          "220150104": {
            "id": "220150104",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Well, this is the humble Bantan Sango Detective Agency. And I am a detective.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150106",
              "220150109"
            ]
          },
          "220150106": {
            "id": "220150106",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "My name is Sango, and I'm the president of this detective agency.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150107"
            ]
          },
          "220150107": {
            "id": "220150107",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Well, I call myself the president, but this detective agency only has two employees.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150113"
            ]
          },
          "220150113": {
            "id": "220150113",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So, is this the first time you've seen a detective agency?"
          },
          "220150109": {
            "id": "220150109",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Huh, that's a good question. From the perspective of the general public, detective work must seem rather special and mysterious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150110"
            ]
          },
          "220150110": {
            "id": "220150110",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But as far as I'm concerned, it's like any other work. It pays the bills.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150111"
            ]
          },
          "220150111": {
            "id": "220150111",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That said, the work is a little unusual sometimes and the clients are occasionally noteworthy individuals...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150112"
            ]
          },
          "220150112": {
            "id": "220150112",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But otherwise, it's a way to make a living just like any other."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201505",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150501": {
            "id": "220150501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I didn't meet a single detective in all my time in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150502"
            ]
          },
          "220150502": {
            "id": "220150502",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Mondstadt... Oh, you mean Mondstadt City. I've heard of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150503"
            ]
          },
          "220150503": {
            "id": "220150503",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The two most famous things about Mondstadt are its wine and its freedom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150504"
            ]
          },
          "220150504": {
            "id": "220150504",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Hahaha, those two things really compliment each other... I suspect that if there were detectives in Mondstadt, their business would be booming every day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201506",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150601": {
            "id": "220150601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've never seen a detective in Liyue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150602"
            ]
          },
          "220150602": {
            "id": "220150602",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Liyue doesn't really need detectives. I've heard about how much they value contracts there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150603"
            ]
          },
          "220150603": {
            "id": "220150603",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Besides, they have the Millelith, who quickly solve problems large and small...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150604"
            ]
          },
          "220150604": {
            "id": "220150604",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Even if there were a detective agency, I suspect it would have to close down due of lack of business."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201507",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220150701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220150701": {
            "id": "220150701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've only met one legal adviser...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150702"
            ]
          },
          "220150702": {
            "id": "220150702",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Legal advisers? Ah... I've heard that... they're pretty difficult to deal with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150703"
            ]
          },
          "220150703": {
            "id": "220150703",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I suspect that what these people do is complicate simple problems. They take something simple and make it complex and then turn it into confusing contracts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220150704"
            ]
          },
          "220150704": {
            "id": "220150704",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I hope I never meet one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
